+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-1">KOI8-U is compatible with KOI8-R in all Cyrillic Letters and
+completes it with four Ukrainian letters UKRAINIAN IE #164, #180,
+CYRILLIC SMALL LETTER BELORUSSIAN-UKRAINIAN I #166, #182, UKRAINIAN
+YI #167, #183, UKRAINIAN GHE WITH UPTURN #173, #189.</t>
